| **Novelty** | Creative bridging of ToM + stable matching; counter-intuitive finding that higher ToM ≠ better cooperation | Novel task formulation (ICL for doc-RE) | Novel evaluation paradigm (VIM) | Novel empirical finding on worst-case bias |
