GPUDrive is a GPU-accelerated multi-agent driving simulator built on the Madrona game engine, achieving 2.3M ASPS (200–300× faster than CPU-based Nocturne), with real-world WOMD data integration, multiple sensor modalities, and pre-trained RL agents achieving 95% goal-reaching.

